                <pb facs="0149" n="99" xml:id="pg99"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 1905.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby, chargé, to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-01"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 1,
                        1894</date>. (Sent 3 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>War is declared. Japanese chargé d’affaires left Peking to-day; has placed
                    interests Japanese subjects in charge of legation of the United States. Outbreak
                    feared Tientsin. Request war vessel.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
